B.ag6=s(["Bu plan i\xe7in bug\xfcnl\xfck yeterince de\u011fi\u015fiklik yapt\u0131k. Yeni bir plan ba\u015flatabilirsin.","That's enough changes to this plan for today. You can start a new plan."],t.s)
B.adF=s(["Plan hakk\u0131n \u015fu an bitti. Devam etmek i\xe7in Yumy Kredisi ya da Yumy Plus gerekir.","You have no plans left right now. Yumy Credits or Yumy Plus let you continue."],t.s)
